{"id":51325,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-gloria-do-ribatejo-2\/"},"modified":"2026-10-02T09:37:09","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T08:37:09","slug":"trail-gloria-do-ribatejo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-gloria-do-ribatejo\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo 2026<\/strong> (12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o, sob o lema <em>Desafia o Trilho<\/em>) realiza-se no dia <strong>1 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partidas a partir das <strong>08:30<\/strong> no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal<\/strong> (junto ao Campo de Futebol) em <strong>Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Salvaterra de Magos<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Esta conceituada jornada de trail running integra o Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo (CTR) e os campeonatos da ATRP.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes desafiar os teus limites no <strong>Trail Longo de 30 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 08:30), no <strong>Trail Curto de 18 km<\/strong> (\u00e0s 09:00), no <strong>Mini Trail de 10 km<\/strong> (\u00e0s 09:15) ou participar na l\u00fadica <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> (\u00e0s 09:20). Todos os percursos s\u00e3o circulares, desenhados pelos cen\u00e1rios naturais da charneca ribatejana, pinhais e trilhos rurais tradicionais.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail do SCD Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo<\/strong>, com a parceria da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Salvaterra de Magos<\/strong> e da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span clas