<!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se a 1 de novembro de 2026 (domingo), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partidas a partir das 08:30 no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo, concelho de Salvaterra de Magos, distrito de Santar\u00e9m.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui o Trail Longo de 30 km (partida \u00e0s 08:30), Trail Curto de 18 km (09:00), Mini Trail de 10 km (09:15) e Caminhada de 10 km (09:20).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal com chip eletr\u00f3nico, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos quentes no pavilh\u00e3o municipal, pr\u00e9mio finisher e fotos gratuitas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe tempo limite para a conclus\u00e3o dos percursos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, todas as provas competitivas de trail e a caminhada t\u00eam um limite hor\u00e1rio m\u00e1ximo de 5 horas para a sua conclus\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial detalhado pode ser consultado no documento oficial da prova: https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/admin\/upload\/ficheiros\/ficheirosMultimedia\/regulamento-xii-trail-final.pdf.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-01\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal, Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Salvaterra de Magos\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail do SCD Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se a 1 de novembro de 2026 (domingo), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partidas a partir das 08:30 no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo, concelho de Salvaterra de Magos, distrito de Santar\u00e9m.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inclui o Trail Longo de 30 km (partida \u00e0s 08:30), Trail Curto de 18 km (09:00), Mini Trail de 10 km (09:15) e Caminhada de 10 km (09:20).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal com chip eletr\u00f3nico, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos quentes no pavilh\u00e3o municipal, pr\u00e9mio finisher e fotos gratuitas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existe tempo limite para a conclus\u00e3o dos percursos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, todas as provas competitivas de trail e a caminhada t\u00eam um limite hor\u00e1rio m\u00e1ximo de 5 horas para a sua conclus\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento oficial detalhado pode ser consultado no documento oficial da prova: https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/admin\/upload\/ficheiros\/ficheirosMultimedia\/regulamento-xii-trail-final.pdf.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69198,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51325","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-salvaterra-de-magos-santarem","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-gloria-do-ribatejo.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51325","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2